Package: turing-unlock-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, dkms,
 turing-unlock-firmware (= ${source:Version})
Description: Unlock full speed FP16 tensor core before the NVIDIA driver loads
 DKMS source for turing_unlock, loaded ahead of nvidia on every boot. It does
 nothing unless turing_unlock.targets= is on the kernel command line.

Package: turing-unlock-firmware
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: locally generated pinned NVIDIA firmware for turing-unlock
 This package is built for the local machine from verified upstream inputs.
